# Normalize line endings for this repo. Blender/bpy addons are pure
# Python + a few text assets (stylesheets, SVGs) - there's no reason
# any of it should carry CRLF, and a mixed-ending file (CRLF and LF in
# the same file) produces noisy, hard-to-review diffs on every future
# edit regardless of which OS or editor made the change.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py  text eol=lf
*.qss text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Binary assets - never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.zip binary

